WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:03,260
See things first and then talk if you are satisfied

2
00:00:03,260 --> 00:00:07,750
This stuff is really good

3
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:18,400
Brother, I want them all

4
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,490
What, you want it all

5
00:00:20,490 --> 00:00:21,690
I came first

6
00:00:21,690 --> 00:00:24,090
Sweet potato costs 75 cents per piece, pumpkin costs 12 cents per piece

7
00:00:24,090 --> 00:00:25,290
Money tickets are acceptable

8
00:00:25,290 --> 00:00:27,540
How to make it

9
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:35,880
It depends on the quality of your goods

10
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:37,680
You should have more than this in your hands, right?

11
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:39,580
what does it mean

12
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:41,780
I wonder if you can get more food.

13
00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:43,580
Cornmeal, high-grain rice, beans

14
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:46,580
Even fine grains can be negotiated on price as long as they are available.

15
00:00:46,580 --> 00:00:52,130
Sure enough, it's here. How much do you want?

16
00:00:52,330 --> 00:00:53,890
The more the better

17
00:00:53,890 --> 00:00:54,890
To tell you the truth

18
00:00:54,890 --> 00:00:56,890
I am the head of the county, the purchasing section chief

19
00:00:56,890 --> 00:00:58,090
Zhu Yuanxun

20
00:00:58,090 --> 00:01:00,490
Our factory is now similar to a machinery factory
